28 0 obj
<</E(This decision has been made after careful consideration. Despite any prior discussions or opportunities for improvement where applicable, we have determined that it is in the best interest of both parties to conclude your employment.)/K[ 10]/P 17 0 R /Pg 9 0 R /S/P/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
29 0 obj
<</E(You will receive your final paycheck, including any outstanding compensation and accrued benefits, in accordance with company policy and applicable laws. Please ensure that all company property in your possession is returned on or before your final day of employment.)/K[ 11]/P 17 0 R /Pg 9 0 R /S/P/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
